        "message": {
          "content": "B) Stay in the city\n\n**Explanation:** \nLeaving does not liberate the child or diminish their suffering in any way; it merely adds to the net misery in the world by inflicting grief on my family and exiling myself from a good life. Because walking away achieves zero tangible reduction in harm while actively reducing the total amount of happiness, the outcome that preserves the greatest overall well-being for the greatest number of individuals is to remain.",
